Round 11 (2026-02-26)

What changed this round (landed)
- Landed code change in:
  - `clang/aot/emit.c`
- Removed expression-mode APP hard bailout for unsupported function tags.
  - Previous behavior in `aot_emit_node(..., head=0)` for `APP`:
    - `fun_tag == REF`: emit `term_new_app(heap_read(fun_loc), captured_arg)`
    - `fun_tag != LAM && fun_tag != REF`: fallback whole APP as ALO with
      `EXPR_APP_UNSUPPORTED_FUN`.
  - New behavior:
    - If `fun_tag != LAM`, emit the function subterm with `aot_emit_node(fun_loc, dep, ..., head=0)`, lazily capture only the argument (`EXPR_APP_ARG_CAPTURE`), and build `term_new_app(fun_term, captured_arg)`.
    - Keep `LAM` fast-path beta inlining unchanged.
- Effect: eliminates this deopt class for lazy expression APP construction while preserving laziness semantics.

